Error [E2520]: ``+`` needs `Screen` space, got `World`.
  --> tests/ui/coordinate_point_mismatch.jet:5:5
    |
 5 |     screen + world_delta
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Coordinate-space tags are ordinary type facts; combining different spaces would make a numerically valid result mean the wrong thing.
 Fix: Use a `Screen` point or displacement, or convert it with a checked transform.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2520
